        "created_at": "2016-06-11T11:17:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We haven't gotten this into the fireside chats yet, and apparently forgot to make the change in the video game (it will be in the next update). The rules have the following addition:&nbsp;<strong><span>When a hero would be destroyed, they are incapacitated, instead.</span></strong></p>",
